<title>USA: Toys R Us ads move to GGT'S Wells Rich.</title>
<headline>Toys R Us ads move to GGT'S Wells Rich.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>GGT Group Plc's Wells Rich Greene BDDP Advertising/New York said it has won the $40 million advertising account of Toys R Us Inc.</p>
<p>Wells Rich had handled some work for Toys R Us on a project basis over the past two years, but the account was handled mostly by WPP Group Plc J Walter Thompson unit.</p>
